# Local Development
#
# This project uses Infisical for secrets management.
# DO NOT create a .env file — use infisical run instead:
#
#   infisical run --env=local -- docker compose up -d
#
# Required Infisical secrets (local environment):
#   DATABASE_URL          - Set automatically by docker compose
#   SESSION_SECRET    - Session signing secret
#   KUBE_API_URL          - Kubernetes API server URL
#   KUBE_TOKEN            - ServiceAccount bearer token
#   CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN  - Cloudflare API token (for DNS)
#   CLOUDFLARE_ZONE_ID    - Cloudflare zone ID
#
# See CLAUDE.md for full setup instructions.
